0..45 Comment "//! This source shows capability attenuation."
46..49 Comment "//!"
50..101 Comment "//! A wider capability can satisfy a narrower need."
102..162 Comment "//! A holder cannot use an operation outside its capability."
163..166 Comment "//!"
167..233 Comment "//! The checker rejects an operation outside the stated authority."
234..294 Comment "//! The host grants the authority that a capability carries."
295..341 Comment "//! The discipline follows Dennis and Van Horn"
342..422 Comment "//! [Dennis-1966-programming_semantics_for_multiprogrammed_computations] and the"
